    "<br /><div style='width:770px; max-width:calc(100% - 202px); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><div><div><div><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.75rem; max-width:100%;'><span style='max-width:100%; display:inherit;'>Landuse is broken into 18 classes: High Density Residential (HDR), Medium Density Residential (MDR), Estate Residential (ESR), Rural Residential (RUR), Cemetery (CEM), Golf Course (GC), Agriculture (AGR), Commercial (COM), Industrial (IND), Institutional (INS), Recreational/Open Space (REC), Mixed Commercial Entertainment (MCE), Airport (AIR), Roads (RDS), Railway (RWY), Vacant Lands (VAL), Aggregate Extraction (AGG), Landfill (LDF).Natural Cover is broken into 5 Classes: Forest (NCF), Successional Forest (NCS), Meadow (NCM), Wetland (NCW) &amp; Beach/Bluff (NCB).On-screen digitized from 2018 orthophotos at approximately 1:2000; minimum forest size 0.5 ha</span></p></div></div></div></div>"
